  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "\"What? You want me to become an A.N.JELL member instead of my brother?!\" \n\nA beautiful girl, cut off from the world, walks the path of a nun. One day, her twin brother, a handsome man, asks her for an unreasonable favor. He wants her to pretend to be a new member of Korea's top idol band, A.N.JELL.  \nBut she can't refuse her brother's request, so she cross-dresses and joins A.N.JELL. Tae-kyung, the cold but charming leader of the group, Shin-woo, a gentle and kind-hearted boy, and Jermi, a bright and cute girl...  \nSurrounded by three angelic-looking men, A.N.JELL will struggle with the ups and downs of life!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10048129), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5078001261)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/297875/)",
